    "issue_key": "MER-123",
    "summary": "Frontend build leaks a server-only integration setting",
    "description": "A deployment audit flags an integration credential in the web build environment; the browser needs only the public API origin.\n\nTribal constraint: Only NEXT_PUBLIC_* variables may enter the bundle; server values come from the 1Password environment item and CI's scanner must inspect build inputs as well as source literals.",
